      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "* * *\nGURBIR SINGH, J. :\nVide this common order, two petitions i.e. CRM-M-4246-2023 and CRM-M-6417-2023 shall be disposed of as the FIR involved in both the petitions is the same, arising out of the same occurrence.",
