    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Suraj Kumar And Another vs The State Of Haryana on 20 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/110194752/\n1",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1151,
      "end": 1277,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Suraj Kumar And Another vs The State Of Haryana",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1152,
          "end": 1199
        },
        {
          "text": "20 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1203,
          "end": 1234
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "As per version in the FIR, complainant made a statement that his grandfather Shri Ramnath had a house and a plot, who died on 27.06.2009.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1278,
      "end": 1415,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1360,
          "end": 1367
        },
        {
          "text": "27.06.2009",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1404,
          "end": 1414
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19790135324001312
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "His grandmother Smt.Treta Devi pre-deceased him on 19.12.1997.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1416,
      "end": 1478,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Treta Devi",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1436,
          "end": 1446
        },
        {
          "text": "19.12.1997",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1467,
          "end": 1477
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22383973002433777
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Bablu's son Nand Lal, along with Suraj, Prakash and Deepika hatched a conspiracy and got a fake Will registered on 23.04.2021 by impersonating some person as grandfather of the complainant and grabbed the property of his grandfather.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1479,
      "end": 1712,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bablu",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1479,
          "end": 1484
        },
        {
          "text": "Nand Lal",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1491,
          "end": 1499
        },
        {
          "text": "Suraj",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1512,
          "end": 1517
        },
        {
          "text": "Prakash",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1519,
          "end": 1526
        },
        {
          "text": "Deepika",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1531,
          "end": 1538
        },
        {
          "text": "23.04.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1594,
          "end": 1604
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19464348256587982
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that Ramnath had executed a Will dated 22.04.2021 before his death on 28.06.2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1713,
      "end": 1844,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1768,
          "end": 1775
        },
        {
          "text": "22.04.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1802,
          "end": 1812
        },
        {
          "text": "28.06.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1833,
          "end": 1843
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3772631585597992
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The complainant had twisted the facts by submitting that Ramnath died on 27.06.2009.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1845,
      "end": 1929,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1902,
          "end": 1909
        },
        {
          "text": "27.06.2009",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1918,
          "end": 1928
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3333752453327179
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The complainant is a relative of the petitioners and residing in the same house in which the petitioners are residing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1930,
      "end": 2048,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3428812623023987
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "In order to grab the property, he has falsely implicated the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2049,
      "end": 2122,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3509770631790161
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The Death Certificate dated 01.02.2022 of grandfather of the petitioners showing his date of death as 27.06.2009 has been annexed as Annexure P-3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2123,
      "end": 2269,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01.02.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2151,
          "end": 2161
        },
        {
          "text": "27.06.2009",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2225,
          "end": 2235
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2518104612827301
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the petitioners has further submitted that the petitioners were granted interim bail by learned Sessions Judge, Faridabad on 23.12.2022.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2270,
      "end": 2427,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sessions Judge, Faridabad",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2387,
          "end": 2412
        },
        {
          "text": "23.12.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2416,
          "end": 2426
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16613973677158356
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "They joined investigation but their anticipatory bail applications were dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2428,
      "end": 2510,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3776015043258667
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "No recovery is to be effected from the petitioners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2511,
      "end": 2562,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2561202347278595
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The case is based on documentary evidence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2563,
      "end": 2605,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23414866626262665
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The Will in question is to be examined by the Civil Court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2606,
      "end": 2664,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21885283291339874
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Therefore, the petitioners be granted concession of anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2665,
      "end": 2736,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3675057888031006
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Learned State counsel has opposed the bail petitions on the ground that verification of death of Ramnath was made from his native 2 of 4 Neutral Citation No:=2023:PHHC:031762 village Awajpur, District Chandoli and it was reported that Ramnath died in the year 2009.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2737,
      "end": 3003,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2835,
          "end": 2842
        },
        {
          "text": "Awajpur",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2921,
          "end": 2928
        },
        {
          "text": "Chandoli",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2939,
          "end": 2947
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2973,
          "end": 2980
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1355912685394287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "A copy of report of Block Development Officer, Dhanapur, Chandoli (UP) has been annexed as Annexure R-1.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3004,
      "end": 3108,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Dhanapur",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3051,
          "end": 3059
        },
        {
          "text": "Chandoli",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 3061,
          "end": 3069
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10696994513273239
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "It is further reported by the said Block Development Officer that earlier report of Gram Panchayat Officer regarding death of Ramnath in the year 2021 was found to be wrong.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3109,
      "end": 3282,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3235,
          "end": 3242
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11292123794555664
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "In these circumstances,\nthe petitioners do not deserve the concession of anticipatory bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3283,
      "end": 3374,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12398290634155273
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Heard.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3375,
      "end": 3382,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.146345317363739
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The dispute is with regard to the Will dated 22.04.2021 executed by Ramnath.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3383,
      "end": 3460,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "22.04.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3429,
          "end": 3439
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3452,
          "end": 3459
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1977258324623108
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "It is specific case of the petitioners that Ramnath died on 28.06.2021.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3461,
      "end": 3532,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3505,
          "end": 3512
        },
        {
          "text": "28.06.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3521,
          "end": 3531
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16865433752536774
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "His Death Certificate has also been placed on the file as Annexure P-3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 3533,
      "end": 3604,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19107629358768463
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "However, during investigation, it was confirmed that Ramnath died in the year 2009 and report of Mr. Ashwani Singh, Gram Panchayat Officer regarding death of Ramnath in the year 2021 was found to be wrong.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3605,
      "end": 3810,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3658,
          "end": 3665
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashwani Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3706,
          "end": 3719
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3763,
          "end": 3770
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2747876048088074
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Prima facie, the petitioners have procured the Death Certificate of Ramnath (Annexure P-3) on the basis of wrong report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3811,
      "end": 3932,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3880,
          "end": 3887
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21868641674518585
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "Petitioner Bablu is witness on the Will dated 22.04.2021 allegedly executed by Ramnath.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3933,
      "end": 4020,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Bablu",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3944,
          "end": 3949
        },
        {
          "text": "22.04.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3979,
          "end": 3989
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4012,
          "end": 4019
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1595766544342041
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "Thus, he had identified the impersonator namely Rambilash as Ramnath.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4021,
      "end": 4090,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rambilash",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4069,
          "end": 4078
        },
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4082,
          "end": 4089
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.33321574330329895
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "The other petitioners Suraj Kumar and Prakash Kumar are beneficiaries of the Will.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4091,
      "end": 4173,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Suraj Kumar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4113,
          "end": 4124
        },
        {
          "text": "Prakash Kumar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4129,
          "end": 4142
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22176483273506165
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "They all joined hands illegally to grab the property of Ramnath.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4174,
      "end": 4238,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ramnath",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
